            "description_html": "<b>Laurey 7/8 Inch Kama Square Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Kama Square Cabinet Knob has a unique style that lends it a rustic feel that is well suited to southwestern kitchen decor. The  7/8 Inch Kama Square Knob is ridged along the side and has a slight pyramid top and both of these features add to its charm. It comes packaged with mounting hardware.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Kama\">Laurey Kama Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 7/8\" Kama Square Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length: 7/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
